# The tw release signing keys (ssh-keygen allowed_signers format), one per
# line: tw-release namespaces="tw-release" ssh-ed25519 <base64> <comment>
#
# Release tarballs carry SHA256SUMS.sig, an SSH signature (ssh-keygen -Y sign
# -n tw-release) of their SHA256SUMS, and the GitHub release carries one of
# the release-level SHA256SUMS. scripts/get.sh, scripts/install.sh and
# tw-hostd's self-upgrade accept only a signature by a key listed here.
#
# This file is the source of truth. scripts/get.sh and scripts/install.sh
# carry copies between their "BEGIN/END tw release signers" markers:
# `sh scripts/release-keygen.sh --sync` rewrites them, and `make test`
# (internal/releasesig) fails if they differ. docs/RELEASING.md, "Signing",
# has the key ceremony and rotation steps.
tw-release namespaces="tw-release" ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIC8VB/53QVWaiyARbdrg6MP6F6LVuQPebi4lhMN4h0Yk tw-release 2026-11-17
